# After a change to B's parents, the early analysis must have B's hash with the new parents,
# or the next change to B recompiles D. Nothing in dep inherits B, so dep compiles in one round.

> use/compile

$ copy-file changes/B1.scala dep/B.scala
> use/compile
> use/checkRecompilations 1 D

$ copy-file changes/B2.scala dep/B.scala
> use/compile
> use/checkRecompilations 1 D
